    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border-left:none;padding:0px;display:flex;font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:medium\"><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 20px;width:542px\"><div><div style=\"font-size:14px;direction:ltr;margin:8px 0px 0px;padding:0px\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:small;line-height:1.5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,I used the package &quot;tidyLPA&quot; in R and I have a problem.My BIC value doesn&#39;t seem to converge.Because I ran 10 times with the same date,each time the BIC value is not the same.But they have a trend.I want to fix its &quot;Convergence criterion&quot; and &quot;Maximum number of iterations&quot;, how can i adjust it? thank you!  <br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;padding:0px;width:auto;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-top:none;margin:0px;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><div style=\"border-top:0px;padding:0px\"><div style=\"clear:both;margin:0px;padding:16px 0px;border-top:none\"></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
