     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi, if you are using the tidyLPA::estimate_profiles() function, it uses the mclust package on the backend. It works by first performing hierarchical cluster analysis to provide starting values for the expectation-maximization algorithm.\r\n Unfortunately, in the present version on CRAN, we don’t provide functionality to change the convergence criterion and the maximum number of iterations, though I believe you an do so through the mclust::emControl() function (which is passed to the mclust::mclust()\r\n function; see here: <a href=\"https://rdrr.io/cran/mclust/man/emControl.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/cran/mclust/man/emControl.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496122012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EwFtTzqP5ggXjsd7_OSvk\">https://rdrr.io/cran/mclust/man/emControl.html</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hope this helps,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Josh<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:Times;color:black\">-- <br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"65\" style=\"width:3.125in;min-height:.677in\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/tidylpa/attach/61fa4658ecc78/image001.gif?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"http://images.utk.edu/images/interface/ut-emailsignature.gif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><a href=\"http://jmichaelrosenberg.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jmichaelrosenberg.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496122012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02UY8O2YQIdI1AJPp1_I4A\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">Joshua M. Rosenberg, Ph.D.</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">Assistant Professor, STEM Education<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">Dept. of Theory and Practice in Teacher Education<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">The University of Tennessee, Knoxville<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\">420 Claxton, 1122 Volunteer Boulevard, Knoxville, TN 37996<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><a href=\"tel:(865)%20974-5973\" value=\"+18659745973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(865) 974-5973</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:#58595b\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">jmros...@utk.edu</span></a></span><u></u><u></u></p></div></div>"
